[ti:Day 10]

[00:00.00]compulsory 例 The dispute was settled by compulsory arbitration. 那场争议已通过强制性仲裁得到解 决。
[00:08.18]attrition 例 It is more a strategy of preventing attrition to other carriers, companies or sites than it is about true customer satisfaction. 该策略与其说 是为了真正满足顾客所需，还不如说是为了防止 和其他销售商、公司或者网站发生相互磨损。
[00:25.75]boredom 例 He had given up practising swimming out of sheer boredom. 出于厌倦，他已经放弃练习 游泳了。
[00:34.08]histogram 例 You can show the research project as a report or a histogram. 你可以选择用报告或者直 方图的形式来展示那个研究项目。
[00:43.01]joint 例 The joint venture is integrated into the dominant parent's management system. 合资 企业由母公司管理。
[00:53.88]redouble 例 We should redouble efforts to adjust the economic structure. 我们应该加倍努力调整经济 结构。
[01:02.96]caliber 例 The members of a once-outstanding economics team have left and have not been replaced by experts of like calibre. 那个曾经十 分杰出的经济学团队的成员都已经离开，却没有 水准相当的专家来替代他们。
[01:18.29]dexterity 例 The new assistant handled the problem with dexterity. 新来的助手灵巧地处理了那个问 题。
[01:26.63]inward 例 In the face of threats from abroad, it can be tempting to seek comfort by turning inward. 面对海外的威胁，转向国内寻求安慰是很 有诱惑力的。
[01:38.54]recompense 例 Our company will recompense your friend for extra work. 我们公司会付给你朋友加班费 的。
[01:47.17]abrasion 例 Abrasion tests are generally carried out before the market entry of the new products. 一般来说，新产品进入市场前都会接受耐磨测 试。
[01:59.23]outweigh 例 Technical innovation will increase production costs, but the gains are expected to outweigh the financial outlays. 技术革新会增 加生产成本，但收益终会大于资金支出。
[02:15.31]identify 例 Because the system cannot identify these users, it serves the same page to all of them. 因为系统不能识别这些用户，所以只能为所有人 提供相同的页面。
[02:27.36]overestimate 例 We always overestimate what we can achieve in a day while underestimating what we can achieve in a year. 我们总是高估自己一 天能完成的事情，却低估自己一年能取得的成 绩。
[02:42.10]cartridge 例 You can get up to 27 percent more pages per ink cartridge in this way. 通过这种方法，每 个墨盒可以多打印多达27%的纸张。
[02:51.93]architect 例 Deng Xiaoping is believed to be China's chief architect of economic reform. 邓小平被 认为是中国经济改革的主要设计者。
[03:02.94]draft 例 I enclose here with a draft the sum of 100 dollars. 兹附上100美元汇票一张。
[03:09.94]aggrieve 例 Personal privacy is aggrieved due to imperfection of network management system. 网络管理体制的不完善使得个人隐私受到侵害。
[03:21.55]contradict 例 Local policy may contradict this execution style for the pattern. 本地政策也许会与这种模 式的执行风格相抵触。
[03:31.52]punctuality 例 Punctuality plays an important role in formal business negotiations. 守时在正式的商 务谈判中至关重要。
[03:42.24]interim 例 He submitted an interim report to his boss. 他向老板递交了一份临时报告。
[03:48.79]prevention 例 It is well known that prevention is better than a cure. 众所周知，预防胜于治疗。
[03:57.12]coach 例 The venture capital firms with consistent interests and behaviour can coach entrepreneurs to grow the business and increase shareholder value. 那些有稳定兴趣和 行为的风险投资公司可以指导创业者壮大公司， 增加股东财富。
[04:16.33]coincide 例 The journalist's interest in a scoop and the source's self-interest coincide. 新闻工作者抢登 内幕新闻的兴趣和消息来源的自身利益一致。
[04:27.64]brochure 例 We will send you a brochure on the various kinds of bicycles now available for export. 现 寄去一份有关我公司目前可供出口的各式自行车 的小册子。
[04:39.55]blanket 例 The reporter reported the blanket coverage of the air pollution in Beijing. 记者对北京空气污 染情况进行了全面报道。
[04:50.27]presumably 例 Presumably the boss has made the decision of firing him. 想必老板已经决定开除他 了。
[04:58.90]excursion 例 The team leader arranged an excursion to the seaside for the whole team. 团队领导为整 个团队安排了一次去海边的远足旅行。
[05:09.32]condemn 例 If they think someone is lying to them, they will feel angry and condemn him. 如果他们认为 某人是在说谎，他们就会感到愤怒并谴责这个 人。
[05:19.89]co-worker 例 Before you leave the office, you should have the contact information of every co- worker you plan to stay in touch with. 在你离 开公司之前，你应该将每个你想保持联系的同事 的联系方式记下来。 concierge service 门房服务
[05:36.11]franchise 例 Windows is one of the franchise brands and products of Microsoft. 视窗操作系统是微软 公司的特许经营品牌和产品之一。
[05:45.79]unchangeable 例 The company has already developed its own business model that is unchangeable. 该 公司已经形成了其稳定的商业模式。
[05:57.70]irritate 例 No one can irritate her except for her son. 除了她的儿子，没人能激怒她。
[06:04.25]attest 例 The government investigators required the company's accountants to attest to the accuracy of their reports. 政府调查官员要求公 司的会计师证实他们的报告的准确性。
[06:19.14]caretaker 例 He signed a six-month contract to serve as the caretaker of an amusement park. 他签订了 一份为期六个月的合同，成为一个游乐场的看管 人。
[06:30.30]contemporary 例 Their impact on contemporary society is enormous and unprecedented. 他们对现代社会 的影响是巨大而空前的。
[06:41.02]saturate 例 The manager is saturated with business knowledge. 经理有着丰富的商务知识。
[06:48.76]constraint 例 There have been several attempts to deal with this kind of constraint. 已经有人做了一些 处理这类约束的尝试。
[06:59.18]drain 例 The drain of money from this country is a serious problem. 这个国家的资金外流是一个严 重的问题。
[07:07.22]boost 例 In China, the easier and cheaper on-line payment service is boosting the industry of e- commerce. 在中国，更加便捷、低价的网上支付 服务正促使电子商务行业快速发展。
[07:20.32]active 例 China has been playing an active role in the peace and stability of the whole world. 中国在 维护世界的和平与稳定方面一向起着积极的作 用。
[07:31.63]dilute 例 The government has taken some measures to dilute public fears about food safety. 政府 已采取了一些措施来淡化公众对食品安全的担 忧。
[07:42.79]anniversary 例 If there is a lesson to be drawn on this anniversary, it is that the United States is one nation and one people united by common ideals. 如果说要从这个纪念日吸取什么教训，那 就是美利坚合众国是一个有共同理想的国家和民 族。
[08:00.95]contingency 例 Establishing contingency reserve is an example of risk acceptance strategy. 建立应急 储备是风险接受战略的例子之一。
[08:12.56]ingenious 例 He is an ingenious person who can make remarkable sculptures from the most ordinary materials. 他很有独创性，用最普通的材料就能 做出出色的雕塑。
[08:25.96]glamour 例 The quick increase of sales volume confirms the glamour of the BMW brand. 迅速 增长的销量印证了宝马汽车的品牌魅力。
[08:36.23]cut 例 When they got people to sign up, you would get a cut of the profits as well. 当他们找 到人来签合同，你的利润就会下降。
[08:45.76]compliance 例 Our bank is facing much higher charges for compliance with the new legislation on the financial services industry. 为遵守新出台的金融 业法规，我们银行正面临着更加庞大的支出。
[09:01.84]branch 例 They have decided to close that branch down. 他们决定把那家分公司关了。
[09:08.39]comply 例 Even if they do comply, it would introduce an element of risk that could affect the bankability of their project. 即使他们遵守了规 定，也会引入可能影响自身项目盈利性的风险因 素。
[09:23.42]refurbish 例 This mobi le phone must have been refurbished by someone. 这部手机肯定已经被谁 翻新过了。
